StockLoop task queue
====================

Sources: .docs/roadmap.md (milestones), .docs/BACKLOG.md (task granularity),
.docs/DECISIONS.md (what still blocks what). This file is the live order;
those files are the reference.

Before any implementation task:
  - the D-xx decisions it depends on must be recorded in docs/decisions/
  - its write paths must be named
  - its acceptance test IDs must be named

[ ] 1. Scaffold web/ — React 18 + TypeScript + Vite, Tailwind configured from the
       /README.md token table, shadcn/ui initialized, app shell ported from
       .template/index.html + assets/styles.css. Acceptance: T-02, T-03, T-04.
       Blocked by: nothing. Write paths: web/ only.

[ ] 2. Scaffold api/ — FastAPI app, uv-managed, async SQLAlchemy + Alembic
       pointing at compose Postgres, /api/health. Acceptance: health returns 200
       with db reachable. Write paths: api/ only.

[ ] 3. Coherent fixture dataset + Postgres schema for Product, Supplier, StockSnapshot,
       SalesRecord (see .docs/DATA-CONTRACTS.md). Acceptance: the oat-milk arithmetic
       in .docs/ACCEPTANCE-TESTS.md T-11/T-13 reproduces exactly.
       Decision needed: D-05, D-06, D-07.

[ ] 4. Deterministic risk view + restock proposal (no AI). Acceptance: T-11, T-12, T-13.
       Decision needed: D-09, D-10.

[ ] 5. Inventory + overview screens against real API data. Acceptance: T-01, T-02, T-03.

[ ] 6. Advisory Gemini explanation behind a server adapter, with rule-based fallback.
       Acceptance: T-16, T-17. Decision needed: D-13.

[ ] 7. Human approval + immutable version + supplier document export.
       Acceptance: T-18, T-19, T-21. Decision needed: D-04, D-11.

[ ] 8. Cloud Run deployment (frontend + backend). Decision needed: D-15.

Each future task is checked off only with evidence, per .docs/BACKLOG.md
("Task completion requires owner authorization and actual evidence").
